 "about": "Room coordinates are airlock.json's vestibule coordinates minus (4, 0, 2), turned half a revolution about the room centre (shell_yaw_deg 180: x -> -x, z -> -z), so the garden wall is the north wall and every station is approached from +Z like the other rooms' equipment walls: suit-up vestibule x -1..4 (inner door to the Commons on the east wall), partition with the inner hatch at x -1, cycled chamber x -4..-1.3 with the outer hatch to the surface on the west wall; the garden wall (z -2) carries the glove ports into Alo's sealed chamber and the sealed carrier pass-through. Samples cross to the garden, people never do (M3-2A decision 1).",
